{"id":"rocket-launch","title":"Rocket Launch!","level":5,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"8317c29c873728889de76b989396c176","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["launch","whoosh","donkey","crew","zoom","clouds","hear"],"common":["there","two","one","they","all","who"],"challenge":["rocket","asleep"],"before":"What would you need to make a rocket out of a box?","after":["What did they make the rocket from?","Who did they meet on the moon?","Why did they zoom home?","Where would you go in a rocket?"],"retell":[2,5,8,9,13,15],"pages":[{"text":"There is a big box in the garden.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"400341e7975d535f99d285d108cb63ce","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A huge empty cardboard box on the lawn of the back garden (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed).","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan and Anastasia turn it into a rocket.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"a0b5a28ee25a0452ac11596256c5f225","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia paint the box: a pointy cardboard nose cone, a round window and fins made from paper plates.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash paints stars on it. They look cool!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9d88106538da2934ed40f404bcfbc163","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash paints yellow stars all over the rocket, and one on Anastasia's cheek.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Three, two, one...","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"Launch!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"d1c33f0b93ccaf6013c3c86583f988d9","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Inside the box rocket: Logan, Anastasia and Dash wear colander helmets and goggles.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"WHOOSH! The rocket shoots up into the clouds!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"71e72212a33e71beeaf68fdbcb15acb8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Magic: the cardboard rocket blasts off from the garden with a flame of sparkles.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They zoom past the moon.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b99de23272988ce1312e7807134a0e3e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Space: the cardboard rocket zips past a big silvery moon with the blue Earth glowing behind.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Bump! They land on the moon.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d0b98eb7904f6542f18f4c940c5e3744","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The rocket has landed in a moon crater with a puff of moon dust.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"A donkey with a jet pack zooms up to them.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"7dbae888f00670619f699107631b9fea","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A friendly donkey astronaut in a white space suit and jet pack, his long ears poking up inside a round fishbowl helmet, waves at them.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The donkey has a crew of moon frogs.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"7c7c7a4c58daf4a4917040f9f209160b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A crew of tiny glowing green moon frogs in little helmets hop around the astronaut donkey in low gravity.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They all jump and jump. Up, up, up!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"a81a26476c22c36e5f0d3d06c23f05b7","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Everyone bounces super high in the low gravity: Dash does a somersault, moon frogs hop, the Earth glows in the sky.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then they hear Mum shout.","bubble":{"who":"mum","name":"Mum","text":"Tea!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"6834f9f7862976406277c5e11b706ca6","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan holds a toy walkie-talkie that crackles with Mum's voice.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They hug the donkey and zoom back down.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"efe638fadf5747b8634baa01cecf1e7f","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan and Anastasia hug the astronaut donkey goodbye while the moon frogs wave.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Crash! They land in Dad's flower bed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"dfd8922345effeb4e3cdbe92a6f00635","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The cardboard rocket lands nose-down in Dad's flower bed, a bit crumpled, and the children climb out laughing.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad is still asleep. He did not see a thing!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c153d3321ce7494bed529e14246d18e0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad snoozes in his deckchair with a newspaper on his tummy, completely unaware.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But who is that on Dad's hat? A moon frog!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"6f9adf3bd2bed1b2ed12c5e20db82481","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A tiny glowing moon frog sits on top of Dad's sun hat, waving at the reader.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}